      "index": "a0",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1377780650,
      "version": 1095,
      "versionNonce": 683984874,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1794919806454,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "-> order of parameter type and value passed through\nconstructor-arg must be same to inject the meaningful\nvalue or avoid incompatible type . --> Spring-DIEx-1 .\n\n\n-> It is much better to use type attribute to avoid such\nambiguity and error . --> Spring-DIEx-2 .\n\n-> Or we can also use index attribute to specify value\npassed must be recieved by which parameter .\n--> Spring-DIEx-3 .\n\n\nBEAN SCOPE\n============\n\nBean scope is an important part of bean creation and it\nhelps the spring container to decide :\n\n-> When the object of Bean will be instantiated .\n\n-> How long will that object will live .\n\n-> How many objects will be created for that bean\nthroughout ?\n\n\nTotal Bean Scopes\n==================\n\n-> singleton\n-> prototype\n-> request\n-> session\n-> global-session\n-> application\n-> websocket",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "-> order of parameter type and value passed through constructor-arg must be same to inject the meaningful value or avoid incompatible type . --> Spring-DIEx-1 .\n\n\n-> It is much better to use type attribute to avoid such ambiguity and error . --> Spring-DIEx-2 .\n\n-> Or we can also use index attribute to specify value passed must be recieved by which parameter .\n--> Spring-DIEx-3 .\n\n\nBEAN SCOPE\n============\n\nBean scope is an important part of bean creation and it helps the spring container to decide :\n\n-> When the object of Bean will be instantiated .\n\n-> How long will that object will live .\n\n-> How many objects will be created for that bean throughout ?\n\n\nTotal Bean Scopes\n==================\n\n-> singleton\n-> prototype\n-> request\n-> session\n-> global-session\n-> application\n-> websocket",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
